#X obj 250 603 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 603 @goffset;
#X text 270 603 Offset parameter that controls grain pointer jumps
between enveloped grain segments. Тип: int. Единицы: 'ms'. Значение
по умолчанию: 0\. Минимальное значение: 0\.;
#X obj 250 660 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 660 @gramp;
#X text 270 660 Grain ramp. For values of @gramp greater than zero
\, a linear envelope will be applied to each grain. If @gramp = 100
\, the resultant grain "window" is triangular while @gramp = 50 produces
a trapezoidal window. Тип: int. Единицы: '%'. Значение по умолчанию:
50\. Диапазон: [1\..100].;
#X obj 250 763 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 763 @random;
#X text 270 763 Factor used when setting individual grain parameters.
This random factor is applied when all grain state durations are calculated.
If set to 0.0 \, no randomness occurs. When @random=0.5 \, a grain
segment of length duration will be randomly augmented by up to +-duration
seconds (i.e. \, a 30 millisecond length will be augmented by an extra
length of up to +15 or -15 milliseconds). Тип: float. Значение по умолчанию:
0.1\. Диапазон: [0\..0.97].;
#X obj 250 911 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 911 @stretch;
#X text 270 911 Stretch factor used for grain playback (1 - 1000).
Granular synthesis allows for time-stetching without affecting the
original pitch of a sound. A stretch factor of 4 will produce a resulting
sound of length 4 times the orignal sound. The default parameter of
1 produces no stretching. Тип: int. Значение по умолчанию: 1\. Диапазон:
[1\..1000].;
#X obj 250 1029 cnv 1 515 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -216373 -1 0;
#X msg 130 1029 @voices;
#X text 270 1029 Number of simultaneous grain "voices" to use. Тип:
int. Значение по умолчанию: 1\. Диапазон: [0\..200].;
